## Phase 3: Cross-Reference the Issues

### Step 3.1: Collect All Issue Numbers
Write them down:
- Testing: `#____`
- Constellation: `#____`
- MCU: `#____`
- UI: `#____`
- Docs: `#____`
- Hardware: `#____`

### Step 3.2: Edit Each Issue to Add Cross-References

For **each** of the 6 issues:
1. Open the issue
2. Click the **"..."** menu (top right of issue body)
3. Click **"Edit"**
4. At the bottom of the body, add:

```
## Related Proposals
This proposal is part of a 6-subproject sovereign architecture portfolio. See also:
- Testing: #[TESTING_NUMBER]
- Constellation: #[CONSTELLATION_NUMBER]
- MCU: #[MCU_NUMBER]
- UI: #[UI_NUMBER]
- Docs: #[DOCS_NUMBER]
- Hardware: #[HARDWARE_NUMBER]

**Master Index:** https://github.com/shalominattii-us/flipper-one-proposals
```

5. Click **"Update comment"**

### Step 3.3: Verify Cross-References
- Click each issue number link to confirm it resolves correctly
- Fix any typos

