## Phase 5: Wait for Signal

### What Happens Next

| Maintainer Response | Your Action |
|---------------------|-------------|
| "Open a PR for [X]" | Fork repo → Create branch → Push code → Open PR |
| "Too big, start smaller" | Scenario B: Offer Testing-only or Docs-only PR |
| "Where do I start?" | Scenario C: Recommend Testing, then Constellation |
| "Show architecture" | Scenario D: Link to `architecture-overview.md` |
| No response after 72h | Scenario E: Pivot to Docs PR, mention code is ready |

### Branch Names (Ready for When They Say "PR")
```
feature/aegentis-testing-diagnostics
feature/aegentis-constellation-mesh
feature/aegentis-mcu-secure-boot
feature/aegentis-ui-scene-gateway
feature/aegentis-docs-golden-dome-hardening
feature/aegentis-hardware-blockchain-identity
```

